    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 07 - Content Calendar Auto-Publisher\nWrite your posts once in Google Sheets and let n8n publish them on time.\n\n- Runs every 15 minutes, picks rows with `Status = scheduled` whose `Publish At` has passed.\n- Routes each post to **LinkedIn**, **X** or a **Telegram channel**.\n- Posts longer than 280 chars are rewritten by AI for X automatically.\n- Every row is updated to `published` (with the post URL) or `failed` (with the error); one bad post never stops the others.\n- A short run report is sent to the admin on Telegram.\n\n**Sheet `Content Calendar` → tab `Posts`:** Post ID, Publish At (yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm), Platform, Text, Status, Published At, Post URL, Error.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
